#: includes/admin-appearance.php:295
msgid "Only turn it off if the site is going to style every diluxone-users-* class itself. Turned off, its panels and buttons come out bare and the site has to draw them; re-pointing the properties is almost always enough, and it survives the plugin adding a new component."
msgstr "Só desative se o site for estilizar cada classe diluxone-users-* por conta própria. Desativada, os painéis e botões saem sem estilo e o site precisa desenhá-los; reapontar as propriedades basta quase sempre, e sobrevive ao plugin adicionar um componente novo."

#: includes/admin-appearance.php:300
msgid "Dark mode"
msgstr "Modo escuro"

#: includes/admin-appearance.php:302
msgid "There is none here, on purpose. Dark mode belongs to the site: a light site seen from a dark system used to end up with a light page and black panels. If the site has a dark mode, its own tokens change and these follow."
msgstr "Aqui não há, de propósito. O modo escuro é do site: um site claro visto de um sistema escuro acabava com a página clara e os painéis pretos. Se o site tem modo escuro, os tokens dele mudam e estes acompanham."

#: includes/admin-appearance.php:306
msgid "Accent colour"
msgstr "Cor de destaque"

#: includes/admin-appearance.php:309
msgid "Buttons, the open tab, links and the drawn avatars."
msgstr "Os botões, a aba aberta, os links e os avatares desenhados."

#: includes/admin-appearance.php:324
