msgstr "Cantos"

#: includes/admin-appearance.php:327
msgid "pixels — empty for the default"
msgstr "pixels — vazio para o padrão"

#: includes/admin-appearance.php:336
msgid "Three layers, in this order: the photo the person uploaded, then Gravatar, then their initials drawn on the accent colour. Turn off the ones you do not want."
msgstr "Três camadas, nesta ordem: a foto que a pessoa enviou, depois o Gravatar, depois as iniciais dela desenhadas sobre a cor de destaque. Desative as que não quiser."

#: includes/admin-appearance.php:340
msgid "Where it comes from"
msgstr "De onde vem"

#: includes/admin-appearance.php:344
msgid "Let people upload their own"
msgstr "Deixar as pessoas enviarem a sua"

#: includes/admin-appearance.php:348
msgid "Fall back to Gravatar when there is none"
msgstr "Recorrer ao Gravatar quando não houver nenhuma"

#: includes/admin-appearance.php:352
msgid "Otherwise, draw their initials"
msgstr "Caso contrário, desenhar as iniciais"

#: includes/admin-appearance.php:354
msgid "Gravatar means sending a hash of every visitor’s email address to a third party. With it off and initials on, nothing leaves the site."
msgstr "Gravatar significa enviar a um terceiro um hash do e-mail de cada visitante. Com isto desativado e as iniciais ativadas, nada sai do site."

#: includes/admin-appearance.php:358
msgid "Largest photo accepted"
msgstr "Maior foto aceita"

